<p>Lightning emanates from you in a circular wave with radius <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">2, 3, 4, 4, 5,</acronym> doing <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">40, 54, 65, 74, 82</acronym> to <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">121, 163, 195, 223, 247</acronym> lightning damage (<acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">81, 109, 130, 149, 165</acronym> average) and possibly dazing anyone affected (75% chance).</p><p>The damage will increase with your Spellpower.</p>